{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And it shall be.</b> And if there were still some of Israel who do not believe the last sign, you shall perform the third sign and they will believe. And it is written, \"and he performed the signs before the eyes of the people\" (below, Exodus 4:30). And this third sign, which is \"and they shall become blood on the dry land,\" is part of the first plague among the ten plagues destined to come."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:27.678640213Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}